MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: SuccessSequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: "player admits to jessi that the deal this whole time was to Get
    Down To Fuck. but not for lustful reasons\n\nplayer tells jessi that she thinks
    that jessi is one Utterly Worthless human being and the only exchange she could
    think of that would best suit someone as Worthless as jessi would be Sex. \n\nto
    the player, sex is a purely transactional act done as a lowly quick favor, not
    an emotionally intimate act. any such emotion is just feigned to make the experience
    better when in reality those who are of low worth just do it to satiate their
    instincts of lust (according to the player).\n\nit is up to people who are \"more
    worthy\" to provide the services to satisfy the worthless, and the player has
    bestowed herself the opportunity to do so to jessi, but she's not simply satisfied
    with that\n\nshe wants to destroy jessi with her own hands; to get rid of one
    of many pieces of filth that dares to breathe the same air as her. she wants
    to turn sex into carnage and fulfill her \"duty\" as one of \"high worth\"\n\njessi
    goes silent but eventually bursts with excitement; she's never felt this way
    before, pumped full of adrenaline and not able to come back down. the player
    is a little taken aback by this, but attempts to keep her composure.\n\njessi
    goes on and on about how the player is the only one that really makes her feel
    anything; everyone else is just Dumb Boring Fucks that refuse her at every turn...
    but for someone to \"care\" about her so much to educate her about how worthless
    she truly is and want to end her existence with their own hands....... she Likes
    It!\n\nthe player comments that this will turn out to be more fun than she expected,
    and the two start to deliberate plans and such..\n\nbefore the player leaves,
    she suggests they make a toast to commemorate this deal. she orders two glasses
    of wine, one for her and one for jessi. jessi excitedly pours the order and sets
    them on the table a little too forcefully, splashing some wine on the counter.\n\njessi
    notices and curses while still in a state of euphoria, offeriing to pour it again,
    but player has another idea. player orders jessi to come close to her and they
    lock lips with each other. jessi, taken aback, struggles to keep up with the
    player, but melts into the kiss....until a jolt of pain rushes to her brain.\n\nshe
    darts back, lip bleeding from the player's forceful bite. player tells jessi
    to let it drip into her own glass to make up for the missing wine. jessi's a
    little weirded out, but she complies because she's honestly too turned on to
    think any better right now.\n\nit drips into her glass, adding ripples of red
    to her drink. they toast to this new chapter and drink.\n\nplayer cements that
    she was correct /pos: jessi atwood is human trash."
  _sameOptionTarget: 0
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well, seems I've convinced her enough.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I suppose now is as good a time as any to finalize this arrangement.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I assume our time is up. Has my performance been satisfactory?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I guess you could say that. Talking to you was way more worth
      it than I thought it would be, honestly...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: So yeah, go ahead, say what your deal thing is or whatever.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: It would be my pleasure.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: As we both know, I've been using this bar to handle some...business
      matters every now and then, yes?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Yeah, and I've been having to stay here overtime for you guys.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: And for that I am thankful.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I couldn't help but think to myself, though, is it not unfair
      that you provide me with a service, only for me to not give anything in return?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: When you put it that way, I guess that makes sense...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: There's nothing I loathe more than an unfair trade. It's simply
      an injustice to do such a thing.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: So, I carefully deliberated on what exactly I could provide for
      you...what exactly would someone like you deserve?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Then it hit me. The perfect exchange.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: As thanks for your services, I propose...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...that we engage in sexual relations.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ?!?!?!?!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ahaha, cat's finally out of the bag, huh?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...y..yeah??? A big fat one at that!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You want to fuck??? You???? With me??????
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'd refrain from using such vulgar language, but yes, that is
      what I'm getting at.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Uh, yeah right, what can a bitch in a wheelchair do???!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'd be pleased to let you find out.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Agh\u2014whatever, just\u2014I wasn't expecting that!!! How was
      I supposed to know you had the hots for me??!!"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Mm, not the reason why I'm extending this offer, but I will have
      to admit you are quite a sight.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: So how the hell was sex the best thing you could think of anyway??!!
      Not, like, money or anything??? Aren't you a really powerful business person
      or whatever???!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I thought about that, but I figured that money would not be appropriate
      for someone like you.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: '"Not appropriate??" What the hell are you talking about???'
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: If you'll allow me to explain.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3493280a97932c747881f09ba5d20724, type: 3}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'Let me ask you this: how do you understand human worth?'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Human...worth?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well...isn't it just how successful you are in life or whatever?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Some homeless bum is probably worth less than a billionaire, right?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hmm, close...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's more about capability.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: One who lives in riches can be much less capable than one who
      lives in poverty.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Whether or not those capabilities have been exercised does not
      determine one's worth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'Another question: do you believe in destiny?'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ehh...kinda sounds like a load of bullcrap.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Or, well, if destiny was a thing, it'd make life infinitely more
      dull if I knew that everything that happened to me was supposed to happen.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: On the contrary; it makes life much more interesting.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: To know one's destiny is to know one's purpose and, thus, to know
      one's worth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Knowing everything you're meant to be and sticking to it makes
      a truly distinguished and valuable person.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Morality, wealth, accomplishments...none of those measure up to
      one's true fate.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: They're merely distractions we've created to hide from the truth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: But I've seen through it all. I see through their lies, their
      cowardice, their shame.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: And I see where their destinies lie; where their value begins
      and ends.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'A final question:'
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: How valuable of a human are you?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...me?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Running into pure wastes of space on the daily, I'd have to say
      at least above average.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Anything less than that and I'd have to consider restarting my
      whole life, haha.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: But really, I am way more deserving of being alive than any of
      those freaks. To even IMAGINE being that worthless...eugh...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...pfft...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...what's up with you?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: HAHAHAHA!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: HAHAHAhaha...oh...oh goodness, I need to catch my breath...wow.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: The hell's so funny?!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ahaha, it's just...ha...you're so...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...incredibly wrong.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: What?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Allow me to educate you on the truth of the matter. Perhaps then
      you will also find this hilarious.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I explained to you earlier that human worth is based on one's
      capability and destiny, yes?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: How much you can and are destined to do sets your value up for
      life; an immutable value resistant to desire.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: No matter how much you want to be something, you are only what
      you're fated to be.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: And you...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...are not destined for anything.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: I can tell by how you conduct yourself and how miserably your
      efforts fail.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: Your feeble attempts to assimilate into society, your inability
      to be loved in any capacity, the sufffering you endure in your day-to-day life...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: It's clear that you aren't destined to be anything meaningful.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: Your existence is pitiful and pointless, and it seems that you're
      the only one that has yet to realize that.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: But that is precisely why I recommended something as crude as
      sexual intercourse for our exchange.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: Because such a lowly act as that suits someone like you perfectly.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: W-what are you talking about?? "Lowly act????"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: Sex is a means of easy transaction. Anyone can offer their body
      up to indulge in lust.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: 'Unlike money, fame, or success, it''s a completely thoughtless
      means of compensation. '
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: People destined for nothing in life just succumb to instinct and
      chase after trivial urges like lust, because it's all that they can do.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: It's up to those who rank higher than them to provide them that
      service and supplement their pathetic existence.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: And I have come to the conclusion that the only way I can repay
      you is to fulfill the desires intrinsic to your kind.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: But it disgusts me to be forced in that position. How dare your
      destiny be so cruel to make you such a useless person?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: So I've altered the conditions to maximize this opportunity I've
      been granted to reinstate your worth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: Simple fornication is not enough to satiate my sheer distaste
      for you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: I want to destroy you from the inside out. Ruin every part of
      you until they're barely recognizable.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: The only way I'll fuck you is if it kills you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _dialogueLine: I will make sure that your life will end by my hands, Jessi Atwood.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hmm...did I go too far in my pitch?
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Perhaps I could've worded all of that in a more...formal manner.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Either way, I'll need her response.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: "...Listen\u2014"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ehe...he...hehehe...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: '?'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: AHAHAHAHA!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: '!!!'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Oh...you are AMAZING!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Haah...I've been waiting for someone like you my entire life......
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Oho..ohohoho.....the adrenaline.....it's unreal!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I've never felt anything like that before...the excitement....
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You're really not anything like them...you're not boring or dull
      or a waste of time...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You're so PERFECT!!! Aghhh...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I want to carve this moment into my brain and never forget it!!!
      Ahaha!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ahh, fuck...my heart is going crazy......it's so wonderful........
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You're the first person to ever make me feel this way.....to ever
      make me feel ANYTHING.....
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: All those other dumb fucks that come here are the same. They're
      all too predictable and too scared to do anything exciting.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: They just want to look and feel good by refusing to be with someone
      as worthless as me...haha...I get it now...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You're...you're so perfect...so much better than everyone else......
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: To have someone care about my pathetic existence so much to want
      to end my miserable, worthless life with their own hands...haah...fuck!!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: FINE!!! I'LL DO IT!!!!! PLEASE LET ME HAVE LIFE-ENDING SEX WITH
      YOU!!!!!!! SHOW ME HOW YOU'LL RIP ME APART AND KILL ME ONCE AND FOR ALL!!!!!!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...huhu, as you wish.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Seems this will be much more fun than I expected. I'm looking
      forward to seeing this deal through with you, Jessi.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Hah, yeah, whatever, just, when do we start??!! Please, I need
      it as soon as possible\u2014I need to be living the life I was MEANT TO LIVE!!!"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Patience, my friend. We've just settled on this arrangement. Its
      execution will come further down the line.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: But, I'm all pent up right now!!! You can't just leave me like
      this!!!! PLEASE!!!!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You really are worthless scum, aren't you? Begging to be fucked
      so desperately...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Though, I'm going to have to make some preparations before our
      first encounter, so you have no other option but to wait.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: UGHHH BUT I CAN'T!!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Perhaps you need something to calm yourself down. How about we
      have a drink or two?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: OH, oh, sure!!! What would you like?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hmm, I can't say I'm particularly looking for a specific flavor
      right now...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You can choose for yourself and surprise me with a second glass.
      Does that sound good?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: What I want..? Hah, okay, whatever you say!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: She turns around and browses the shelves behind her, eyes scrolling
      through the arrays of bottles. When it seems she finally lands on one, she
      haphazardly grabs two glasses and pours a crimson liquid into each.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Jeez, is she that excited that she forgot how to serve drinks
      correctly?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Okay, I got everything!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: "One glass is placed on the counter. The other\u2014"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: FUCK!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...spills a quarter of its volume to a hasty landing.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Damn it, I'm just...aghh I can't think straight right now!!!
      I'll go fill it up again, hang on\u2014"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Just a second.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I think I have a better idea.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: '?'
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Come closer.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: She leans over the counter, careful not to get any of the pool
      of wasted liquid onto her clothes.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: But I won't allow her to be cautious. I grab her by her collar
      and close the distance between us, our lips meeting each other in the middle.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I can feel her shock without having to look at her face. She's
      clawing onto the counter to find a semblance of balance, but my pull is stronger.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Her mouth is still, but quickly succumbs to the motions of my
      own. What a fast learner.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: It isn't long before she's fully melted into the kiss I've gifted
      her. To be expected of her pathetic nature, surrendering to such pleasures
      so easily.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: But this is far from a gift.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: '*CHOMP*'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: '!!!'
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: "My teeth waste no time sinking into her flesh\u2014her bottom
      lip becomes hopelessly ensnared."
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: She tries to escape, but I've got her beat once again. Her attempts
      to pull away only makes me bite harder, and every tug only makes the tear in
      her skin bigger.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Only when a metallic taste enters my mouth do I let go, and she
      nearly falls back onto the shelves until she manages to catch the counter.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Eyes wide, her free hand darts to her mouth to check the damage.
      I examine her wound as well, making sure I have succeeded.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: A concoction of blood and saliva run down her chin, some dripping
      onto already stained shirt. My idea has worked beautifully.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You may use that to refill your glass.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...haha...hahahahaHAHAHA! Oh, you're a fucking genius!!!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: She grabs her glass to catch the dripping mixture, bringing it
      closer to make sure she doesn't miss a drop.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ripples of red fall continously into her glass until it seems
      she's satisfied, wiping her mouth with her sleeve. In accordance, I raise my
      drink.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Here's to this new chapter.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hell yeah!!!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Our glasses clink and we each take a sip. For a piece of filth,
      her taste in alcohol is rather pleasant.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Once I finish, I bid her farewell and take my leave.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: That truly couldn't have gone any smoother. A perfectly balanced
      transaction is one I love to see.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: My judgment has proven correct once again. It always does, because
      this is just how the world works. How people are.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: And Jessi Atwood...
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...is human trash.
